1
00:00:08,647 --> 00:00:11,120
♪Amid the sea of faces♪

2
00:00:11,156 --> 00:00:14,104
♪Our eyes meet by chance♪

3
00:00:14,299 --> 00:00:17,477
♪Through the restless years♪

4
00:00:17,572 --> 00:00:20,944
♪Time suddenly slows♪

5
00:00:21,846 --> 00:00:24,017
♪No vows need be made♪

6
00:00:24,055 --> 00:00:26,744
♪Though seas and mountains lie ahead♪

7
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,607
♪One glance says it all♪

8
00:00:29,627 --> 00:00:33,264
♪Beyond a thousand words♪

9
00:00:34,176 --> 00:00:37,449
♪With you by my side♪

10
00:00:37,482 --> 00:00:40,735
♪I dare brave a thousand trials♪

11
00:00:40,761 --> 00:00:43,852
♪Though mist may veil the road ahead♪

12
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:47,402
♪Hand in hand, no counting years♪

13
00:00:47,419 --> 00:00:50,589
♪With you by my side♪

14
00:00:50,616 --> 00:00:54,264
♪No need to speak my heart at length♪

15
00:00:54,307 --> 00:00:57,267
♪As rivers and mountains change♪

16
00:00:57,324 --> 00:00:59,408
♪May we remain together♪

17
00:00:59,429 --> 00:01:01,984
♪From dawn to dusk♪

18
00:01:01,984 --> 00:01:06,984
=Daughter of a Concubine=

19
00:01:06,984 --> 00:01:09,904
=Episode 7=

20
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,359
General.

21
00:01:23,359 --> 00:01:24,680
This is the place.

22
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:44,040
You're from the Cheng family, right?

23
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,400
I'm Cheng Mingzhi,

24
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:48,439
the eldest grandson of the Cheng family.

25
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,719
Did you come to ask me

26
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:53,200
about your grandfather's death?

27
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,200
Yes.

28
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:02,400
He didn't die of illness.

29
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,280
He was poisoned.

30
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,799
That's all I can say.

31
00:02:08,599 --> 00:02:09,319
Why?

32
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:10,719
If I tell you,

33
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:13,280
my whole family will be killed.

34
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,120
Go.

35
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:17,639
And don't tell anyone you were here.

36
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,319
Physician Li!

37
00:02:36,479 --> 00:02:38,080
Who in the Cheng family

38
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,719
do you serve?

39
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,360
Looks like I was right.

40
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,599
They serve someone in the Cheng family.

41
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,199
General, you go first. I'll cover you!

42
00:03:04,199 --> 00:03:04,919
We'll leave together.

43
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:05,680
General!

44
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,360
Enough!

45
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:46,919
I once heard My Lady say

46
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:50,560
the Cheng family's Third Master
died young.

47
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:54,039
Third Madam stayed behind,

48
00:03:54,039 --> 00:03:56,680
raising Third Lady on her own.

49
00:03:57,719 --> 00:04:01,120
The day Old Master passed away,

50
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:06,120
Third Madam had gone
to a temple outside the city to pray.

51
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:08,360
She didn't return until the next day.

52
00:04:08,639 --> 00:04:10,120
By the time she got back,

53
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:12,680
Old Master was already dead.

54
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:13,639
However,

55
00:04:14,039 --> 00:04:17,319
they found poison in her room.

56
00:04:19,759 --> 00:04:21,160
She wasn't even at the residence.

57
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,759
How did the poison end up in her room?

58
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:29,560
The whole household claimed
she'd poisoned him before leaving.

59
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,519
Nannie,

60
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:31,720
what else do you know?

61
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,720
After that,

62
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:36,639
she was married off to the Xia family.

63
00:04:38,319 --> 00:04:39,439
Xiaoxuan,

64
00:04:39,439 --> 00:04:42,120
your mother must've found out something,

65
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,120
that's why she was killed.

66
00:04:43,199 --> 00:04:44,319
Mine too.

67
00:04:45,879 --> 00:04:47,920
Back then, how did Second Aunt get along

68
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,439
with Old Master and your mother?

69
00:04:50,199 --> 00:04:51,480
They were never on good terms.

70
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,680
Zhou Lanxin was jealous of my mother.

71
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:55,319
She often angered Old Master,

72
00:04:55,399 --> 00:04:56,839
and was punished several times.

73
00:04:57,839 --> 00:04:59,160
I've suspected her all along.

74
00:05:01,439 --> 00:05:02,600
For now,

75
00:05:02,639 --> 00:05:03,680
she's our prime suspect.

76
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,680
She had a motive.

77
00:05:05,399 --> 00:05:07,720
But we can't jump to conclusions.

78
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:08,959
We need to investigate thoroughly.

79
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:11,279
Xiaoxuan,

80
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:13,839
will you help me?

81
00:05:17,519 --> 00:05:18,319
Yunyi,

82
00:05:19,319 --> 00:05:20,360
ever since I was little,

83
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,360
no one in the Cheng family

84
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,959
has ever asked what I wanted.

85
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,439
Well, from now on,

86
00:05:31,519 --> 00:05:32,920
here at the Cheng Residence,

87
00:05:32,959 --> 00:05:33,759
you,

88
00:05:33,759 --> 00:05:34,279
me,

89
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:35,240
and Nanny Zhao,

90
00:05:35,399 --> 00:05:37,480
we'll only make it

91
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,959
if we stick together.

92
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,160
All right.

93
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:45,120
(Ever since I joined the Cheng family,)

94
00:05:45,199 --> 00:05:47,079
(she's been targeting me at every turn.)

95
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,480
(Zhou Lanxin,)

96
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,560
(if you're really hiding something,)

97
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:53,759
(you've got quite the nerve
to give yourself away.)

98
00:05:53,759 --> 00:05:55,040
(Yunting Qinyue)

99
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,199
Yesterday at the Xia Residence,

100
00:05:56,639 --> 00:05:58,600
Cheng Mingzhi humiliated me
in front of everyone.

101
00:05:58,759 --> 00:05:59,920
He made me look like a fool!

102
00:06:00,839 --> 00:06:01,639
Mother,

103
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,040
you have to get even for me!

104
00:06:04,519 --> 00:06:05,399
Humiliated?

105
00:06:05,839 --> 00:06:07,240
Haven't you embarrassed yourself
enough already?

106
00:06:12,519 --> 00:06:13,600
Madam.

107
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,439
What is it?

108
00:06:14,959 --> 00:06:16,600
I overheard Third Miss talking

109
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:19,800
with that blind woman
in the East Courtyard today.

110
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:23,480
They were discussing Third Madam's case.

111
00:06:26,639 --> 00:06:27,680
Go on.

112
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:31,560
That blind woman said
she'll look into Third Madam's death.

113
00:06:32,319 --> 00:06:33,439
I thought,

114
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:36,199
a new bride poking into an old case

115
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,759
is hardly appropriate.

116
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,279
You're certainly devoted.

117
00:06:45,959 --> 00:06:47,279
Thank you, Madam.

118
00:06:47,399 --> 00:06:48,439
Remember this:

119
00:06:48,439 --> 00:06:50,199
as long as that blind woman is around,

120
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:53,160
you'll never win Cheng Mingzhi's heart.

121
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,519
I told you to keep an eye on her

122
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,959
not for my sake,

123
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,240
but for your own good.

124
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:00,879
Understand?

125
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,759
Yes, Madam.

126
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,319
Why all the whispering?

127
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:22,480
No outsiders here.

128
00:07:25,279 --> 00:07:27,120
Cheng Mingzhi isn't home right now,

129
00:07:27,759 --> 00:07:29,720
and that blind woman is all alone.

130
00:07:31,079 --> 00:07:33,800
This is our chance.

131
00:07:35,199 --> 00:07:35,920
Mother,

132
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:36,759
what do you have in mind?

133
00:07:36,759 --> 00:07:39,199
Remember the dry well in the backyard?

134
00:07:40,439 --> 00:07:41,879
You mean...

135
00:07:41,879 --> 00:07:43,519
a blind woman wandering around at night

136
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,879
could easily fall into a dry well.

137
00:07:45,079 --> 00:07:46,680
No one would find that suspicious.

138
00:07:48,639 --> 00:07:49,680
But she's not an idiot.

139
00:07:49,959 --> 00:07:51,360
How do we get her there?

140
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:01,920
Let go of me!

141
00:08:02,959 --> 00:08:04,000
Let go of me!

142
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:06,399
Let go of me!

143
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,160
Let go of me!

144
00:08:08,279 --> 00:08:09,439
Let go of me!

145
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:13,000
So you chose the stick over the carrot.

146
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,759
Knock her out and take her away!

147
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:15,560
Stop!

148
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:21,680
Let go of me!

149
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,600
Come here, Xiaoxuan.

150
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,319
Yunyi.

151
00:08:25,399 --> 00:08:26,639
Second Madam ordered us to do this!

152
00:08:28,879 --> 00:08:30,439
You're blind.

153
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:33,080
Keep your nose out of it.

154
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:37,080
I'm Cheng Mingzhi's principal wife,

155
00:08:37,279 --> 00:08:39,279
the Eldest Young Madam
of this household.

156
00:08:39,639 --> 00:08:41,279
You worthless servant,

157
00:08:41,279 --> 00:08:42,879
how dare you speak to me like that?

158
00:08:44,519 --> 00:08:46,279
Go tell Zhou Lanxin:

159
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:48,480
Cheng Xiaoxuan is under my protection.

160
00:08:48,799 --> 00:08:50,399
Don't you dare touch her again!

161
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:00,759
Let's go.

162
00:09:07,759 --> 00:09:08,360
Yunyi.

163
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,759
Don't be afraid, Xiaoxuan.

164
00:09:09,759 --> 00:09:11,440
They've taken Nanny Zhao.

165
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:14,639
Go back first.

166
00:09:14,799 --> 00:09:15,600
I'll find her.

167
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:17,039
But you can't see.

168
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,120
I'll come with you.

169
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,960
I know every path here by heart.

170
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:22,879
You'd only slow me down.

171
00:09:22,879 --> 00:09:23,600
Be good.

172
00:09:24,679 --> 00:09:25,480
Be good.

173
00:09:44,159 --> 00:09:45,240
Nanny Zhao?

174
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,080
Nanny Zhao?

175
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,639
Nanny Zhao?

176
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:56,840
Xia Yunyi.

177
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:58,960
You're here.

178
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,679
Second Aunt.

179
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:01,720
Where's Nanny Zhao?

180
00:10:02,399 --> 00:10:04,240
She's right here.

181
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:06,440
Want to save her?

182
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,919
Come and get her.

183
00:10:10,879 --> 00:10:12,440
(If I don't play along,)

184
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,799
(she'll see right through me.)

185
00:10:19,279 --> 00:10:20,200
Nanny Zhao?

186
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,960
Answer me.

187
00:10:22,279 --> 00:10:23,039
Come on.

188
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,200
Come over here.

189
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:25,840
She's right here.

190
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,639
Second Aunt,

191
00:10:42,639 --> 00:10:43,759
I can't see.

192
00:10:44,039 --> 00:10:45,360
Please help me over.

193
00:10:45,399 --> 00:10:46,200
All right.

194
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,360
Let me help you.

195
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:49,879
Come.

196
00:11:28,553 --> 00:11:33,920
♪Let the past be buried in the wind♪

197
00:11:35,379 --> 00:11:39,960
♪Perhaps the waning moon knows my pain♪

198
00:11:40,430 --> 00:11:44,350
♪It sees the old tenderness
all come to nothing♪

199
00:11:44,424 --> 00:11:47,640
♪How many regrets haunt this world♪

200
00:11:47,662 --> 00:11:53,760
♪By the window, whose dreams flicker
by the dying candle♪

201
00:11:56,006 --> 00:12:00,360
♪Things remain, you're gone,
and I'm still dazed♪

202
00:12:01,539 --> 00:12:03,720
♪The sandstorm in my eyes♪

203
00:12:03,740 --> 00:12:07,080
♪Turns to a blade's edge♪
(Cheng Residence)

204
00:12:08,410 --> 00:12:10,080
♪Cutting through old years♪

205
00:12:10,141 --> 00:12:11,667
♪We can never embrace again♪

206
00:12:11,683 --> 00:12:16,880
♪If rain has tears,
wash away the dust of fate♪

207
00:12:17,015 --> 00:12:18,613
♪By lamplight, I turn the page♪

208
00:12:18,623 --> 00:12:21,633
♪The ink dries, and there you are♪

209
00:12:21,682 --> 00:12:23,440
♪Gone to ash in a flash♪

210
00:12:23,473 --> 00:12:25,160
♪Like a blade through my heart♪

211
00:12:25,182 --> 00:12:28,633
♪Too late to pull away♪

212
00:12:28,655 --> 00:12:31,180
♪The song ends, and all have gone♪

213
00:12:31,211 --> 00:12:35,440
♪Now we must part♪

214
00:12:35,479 --> 00:12:38,974
♪Flowers burn the ground,
yet vows are held so lightly♪

215
00:12:38,985 --> 00:12:42,440
♪The song ends.
Where shall I seek you in dreams♪

216
00:12:42,722 --> 00:12:44,506
♪By the window, a dying candle♪

217
00:12:44,549 --> 00:12:49,680
♪Whose shadow do I yearn for♪
